BE IT ORDAINED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF CHEYENNE,
WYOMING:
Section 1.That Section 8.52.040, Distribution of Handbills in Public Places, of Chapter
8.52, Handbills, of Title 8, Health and Safety, of the Code of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, is
hereby repealed as set out in this ordinance.Sections currently existing within Chapter 8.52 not
set out within this ordinance remain unchanged.
8.52.040
Distribution-of handbills in pub lie places.
No person-may throw or deposit any handbill in or upon any sidewalk, street, or other
publie place.
Section 2.That this ordinance shall be in full force and effect upon its approval and
publication.
